subckt dut (VSS)
C1 (net2 VSS) capacitor c=1p
C2 (net0 VSS) capacitor c=1p
C3 (net1 VSS) capacitor c=1p
L1 (net3 net2) inductor l=1n
L2 (net2 net0) inductor l=1n
L3 (net0 net1) inductor l=1n
R1 (net1 VSS) resistor r=1k
vin (net3 VSS) vsource type=sine dc=0 ampl=1 freq=1k delay=0 damp=0 sinephase=0
